---
<SiteLayout title="Accessibility Statement | Roofriva Demo" description="Accessibility goals for the Roofriva demonstration roofing website template."><section class="inner-hero"><div class="shell"><h1>Accessibility Statement</h1></div></section><section class="prose"><div class="content-shell"><p>This template is designed with WCAG 2.2 AA principles in mind, including semantic structure, keyboard navigation, visible focus states, form labels, color contrast and reduced-motion support. Final compliance depends on future client content, integrations and customization.</p><p>If you encounter an accessibility issue in this demonstration, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p></div></section></SiteLayout>